    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Combine The Five Elements</h2>In the game you play as a <strong>fish wizard</strong> that has the ability to combine elements into different spells:<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1637140/extras/ae113251081df3f6ab2f0c30fa2d1bd1.avif?t=1673028336\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Intense, Wacky, Skill-shot PVP!</h2>Learn which elements combine into what spell, how to switch between spells quickly and become a <strong>dominating force!</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1637140/extras/5f10a086348fe047a765edc1dd11dd61.poster.avif?t=1673028336\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1637140/extras/5f10a086348fe047a765edc1dd11dd61.webm?t=1673028336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1637140/extras/5f10a086348fe047a765edc1dd11dd61.mp4?t=1673028336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gorgeous Graphics</h2>Fishards looks like a 2D game, however, it\u2019s really just 3D models rendered in low resolution and scaled up!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1637140/extras/fec420060faabe3c9abf9a08e25fc598.poster.avif?t=1673028336\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1637140/extras/fec420060faabe3c9abf9a08e25fc598.webm?t=1673028336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1637140/extras/fec420060faabe3c9abf9a08e25fc598.mp4?t=1673028336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Combine The Five Elements</h2>In the game you play as a <strong>fish wizard</strong> that has the ability to combine elements into different spells:<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1637140/extras/ae113251081df3f6ab2f0c30fa2d1bd1.avif?t=1673028336\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Intense, Wacky, Skill-shot PVP!</h2>Learn which elements combine into what spell, how to switch between spells quickly and become a <strong>dominating force!</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1637140/extras/5f10a086348fe047a765edc1dd11dd61.poster.avif?t=1673028336\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1637140/extras/5f10a086348fe047a765edc1dd11dd61.webm?t=1673028336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1637140/extras/5f10a086348fe047a765edc1dd11dd61.mp4?t=1673028336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gorgeous Graphics</h2>Fishards looks like a 2D game, however, it\u2019s really just 3D models rendered in low resolution and scaled up!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1637140/extras/fec420060faabe3c9abf9a08e25fc598.poster.avif?t=1673028336\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1637140/extras/fec420060faabe3c9abf9a08e25fc598.webm?t=1673028336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1637140/extras/fec420060faabe3c9abf9a08e25fc598.mp4?t=1673028336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "short_description": "Combine the intense, skill-shot PVP of Magicka or Battlerite with some wacky 2-legged-fish and you've got yourself Fishards! The unique spell combining mechanic creates a brand new type of PvP\u200b \u200barena\u200b experience that you have to try with friends!",
